# Automatic differentiation

The `math/grad` package computes derivatives of GX functions.

`grad.Reverse(square)` returns a new function generated by the compiler. That function returns the result of `square` together with a backward function. The backward function computes a vector-Jacobian product: called with 1, it returns the derivative of `square` at 3, that is 6.

Add `trace(vjp)` to `Main` to see the code generated by the compiler.

